  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Sets up the cursor sprites: offsets 18/25, X MSB off, sprites off, in front of the picture, hi-res. Runs cursor_sprites_script and brush_cursor_0 (the arrow), then cursor_on."},
    {"at":38,"placement":"line","text":"Lets the IRQ flash the cursor (cursor_colour_enable = 1), then cursor_sprites_on."},
    {"at":42,"placement":"line","text":"Sets cursor_sprite_mask to $cf (sprites 0-3, 6 and 7). read_cursor copies it to $d015 while the pad is touched."},
    {"at":47,"placement":"line","text":"Changes the colour of all 8 sprites between black and light grey. The IRQ calls it (by $0a25) while cursor_colour_enable is set."},
    {"at":54,"placement":"line","text":"Sets the colour of all 8 sprites to black."},
    {"at":61,"placement":"side","text":"Sets $d027-$d02e to A."},
    {"at":70,"placement":"line","text":"Hides the cursor: stops the flash, clears cursor_sprite_mask and turns all sprites off."},
    {"at":80,"placement":"line","text":"Reads the pad (sample_pad) and converts it to screen units (pad_to_screen) in cursor_x (0-$9f) and cursor_y (0-$c7). No touch (pad Y $e6 or more, or X and Y both below 10) gives cursor_x = $ff and sprites off; pad Y $e6 or more also sets pad_untouched and counts off_pad_count up to 16. A touch clears off_pad_count and turns on the sprites in cursor_sprite_mask. In Mirror mode it also keeps the position folded into the top left quarter in scratch_byte and mirror_cursor_y. Returns X = cursor_x, Y = cursor_y."},
    {"at":91,"placement":"side","text":"Stops the sound of voice 1 and clears pad_untouched."},
    {"at":141,"placement":"side","text":"Mirror mode: X >= 80 gives 159 - X."},
    {"at":177,"placement":"line","text":"Reads the cursor (read_cursor), then moves the cursor sprites to it (move_cursor_sprites)."},
    {"at":180,"placement":"line","text":"Moves the cursor sprites to cursor_x, cursor_y. Sprites 0-5 are a block of 3 columns (24 pixels apart: 0/1, 2/3, 4/5) and 2 rows (21 lines apart); sprites 6 and 7 (the tool label) are 33 lines below sprite 0. Does nothing when cursor_x = $ff. In Mirror mode, cursor_x and cursor_y then get the folded position from read_cursor."},
    {"at":312,"placement":"side","text":"The label sprites go off the screen bottom."},
    {"at":334,"placement":"line","text":"Moves one sprite to screen X = A * 2 + 24 and Y = cursor_y + 50. Input: A = x (0-159), X = 2 * sprite number, Y = the bit of the sprite in $d010."}
  ],
